  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kids Educ. Engagement Proj- Micro grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promote literacy and a reading culture among children and youth in underserved communities in Montserrado County. The project directly addresses the critical problem of low reading fluency and limited access to books for children in underserved communities. The project will strengthen foundational reading and literacy skills, expand access to culturally relevant learning materials/books and build a stronger culture of reading and storytelling beyond the classroom.</narrative>
  </description>
